# Closed daily candles fetched directly from Binance (symbols: BNBUSDT, BTCUSDT; dates are UTC days, inclusive)
GET {{CryptoMarketAnalytics.Api_HostAddress}}/api/market/klines?symbol=BNBUSDT&from=2026-10-01&to=2026-10-31
Accept: application/json

